Available Commands:
Load Image: load image-path image-name
   - Loads image, must be used for any of the following commands to work excluding quit
   - Ex: load res/fourPixels.ppm fourPixels
Save Image: save image-path image-name
   - Saves image, must have loaded at least one image
   - Ex: save res/newFourPixels.ppm fourPixels
Red-Component: red-component image-name dest-image-name
   - Red-scales image, must have loaded at least one image
   - Ex: red-component fourPixels redFourPixels
Green-Component: green-component image-name dest-image-name
   - Green-scales image, must have loaded at least one image
   - Ex: green-component fourPixels greenFourPixels
Blue-Component: blue-component image-name dest-image-name
   - Blue-scales image, must have loaded at least one image
   - Ex: blue-component fourPixels blueFourPixels
Value: value image-name dest-image-name
   - Value-scales image, must have loaded at least one image
   - Ex: value fourPixels valueFourPixels
Luma: luma image-name dest-image-name
   - Luma-scales image, must have loaded at least one image
   - Ex: luma fourPixels lumaFourPixels
Intensity: intensity image-name dest-image-name
   - Intensity-scales image, must have loaded at least one image
   - Ex: intensity fourPixels intensityFourPixels
Horizontal Flip: horizontal-flip image-name dest-image-name
   - Horizontally flips image, must have loaded at least one image
   - Ex: horizontal-flip fourPixels horizontalFourPixels
Vertical Flip: vertical-flip image-name dest-image-name
   - Vertically flips image, must have loaded at least one image
   - Ex: vertical-flip fourPixels verticalFourPixels
Brighten: brighten increment image-name dest-image-name
   - Brightens image, must have loaded at least one image
   - Ex: brighten fourPixels brightenFourPixels
Darken: darken increment image-name dest-image-name
   - Darkens image, must have loaded at least one image
   - Ex: darken fourPixels darkenFourPixels
Sharpen: sharpen image-name dest-image-name
   - Sharpens image, must have loaded at least one image
   - Ex: sharpen fourPixels sharpenFourPixels
Blur: blur image-name dest-image-name
   - Blurs image, must have loaded at least one image
   - Ex: blur fourPixels blurFourPixels
Grayscale: grayscale image-name dest-image-name
   - Grayscale color transformation on image, must have loaded at least one image
   - Ex: grayscale fourPixels grayscaleFourPixels
Sepia: sepia image-name dest-image-name
   - Sepia color transformation on image, must have loaded at least one image
   - Ex: sepia fourPixels sepiaFourPixels
To Quit: q or Q
   - Quits program

Conditions:
An image must be loaded before performing any other command. Besides that, the commands can be run in any order.